	Bailey looks at your tearful face for a long moment before <<he>> climbs off of you. Once standing, <<he>> lets out a long sigh.<<stress 3>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>

	Then <<he>> gathers you in <<his>> arms and lifts you, carrying you to <<his>> bed. <<He>> leaves you for a moment there before returning from the bathroom with a first aid kit. <<He>> treats your injuries wordlessly.<<pain -20>><<lpain>><<stress -6>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>

	"Just say no next time, brat," <<he>> says to you flatly. "Know your own limits. Don't waste my time if you can't take it."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> pulls the bedsheet over you and leaves you alone in bed. Still in pain and exhausted, you find yourself falling asleep quickly.
	<br><br>

	<<baileyWeekendVisitDone>><<set $bailey_weekend_visits += 1>>
	<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Bailey Date All Night Morning]]>><<set $bailey_sleep_config to "alone_bed">><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
